  "design": {
    "idea": "ASTONISHING ROOM \u2014 The Moving Chamber: the Shifting Woods rule turns inside the Hollow Oak. Hanging your lantern on a cardinal hook leaves the opposite walls dark for 1.2 s so the inner vault rotates 90 deg clockwise! Spin rot 0->1->2 to align Key #3's cracked vault onto the south bridge, Beam it for wick_key_3_3, then spin to rot 3 to align the Blue Transformer and open Cycle 5 into oak_r8.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Intentional darkness-triggered chamber rotation (ring_rot 0..3) + Blue Beam bank",
    "decisions": 11,
    "expert_s": 68,
    "reward": "wick_key_3_3 + Cycle 5 shortcut to oak_r8",
    "why": "Centerpiece astonishing room turning Island 3's Shifting Wood rule into an indoor puzzle box",
    "exit": "exit_oak_r7b_nw_r8",
